{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57573","headline":"二气产黄芽歌 · 无名氏","name":"二气产黄芽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾坤感应始爲形，造化元因北户成。\n日月周旋魂魄合，阴阳交媾结爲精。\n分明一气从金长，认取黄芽自水生。\n无限虚於尘世里，时人日用不知名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}